{title: In The Sanctuary}
{key: Eb}

{comment: Verse 1}
[Cm]We lift our [Ab/F]hands in the [Bb]sanctua[Eb]ry.
[Cm]We lift our [Ab/F]hands to [Bb]give you the [Eb]glory.
[Cm]We lift our [Ab/F]hands to [Bb]give you the [Eb-Bb/D]praise,[Cm]
And we will [Ab/F]praise you for the [Bb]rest of our [Eb-Bb/D]days.[Cm]
Yes, we will [Ab/F]praise you for the [Bb]rest of our [Eb]days.

{comment: Chorus}
[Ab-Eb]Jesus, we [Bb]give you the [Eb]praise.
[Ab-Eb]Emmanuel, we [Bb]lift up your [Eb]name.
[Db]Heavenly [Ab]Father, coming [Bb-B-Cm]Messiah,
[Ab/F]We will praise you [Bb]for the rest of [Eb]our days.
[Cm]Yes, we will [Ab/F]praise you for the [Bb]rest of our [Eb]days.

{comment: Verse 2}
[Cm]We clap our [Ab/F]hands in the [Bb]sanctua[Eb]ry.
[Cm]We clap our [Ab/F]hands to [Bb]give you the [Eb]glory.
[Cm]We clap our [Ab/F]hands to [Bb]give you the [Eb-Bb/D]praise,[Cm]
And we will [Ab/F]praise you for the [Bb]rest of our [Eb-Bb/D]days.[Cm]
Yes, we will [Ab/F]praise you for the [Bb]rest of our [Eb]days.

{comment: Verse 3}
[Cm]We sing our [Ab/F]song in the [Bb]sanctua[Eb]ry.
[Cm]We sing our [Ab/F]song to  [Bb]give you the [Eb]glory.
[Cm]We sing our [Ab/F]song to  [Bb]give you the [Eb-Bb/D]praise,[Cm]
And we will [Ab/F]praise you for the [Bb]rest of our [Eb-Bb/D]days.[Cm]
Yes, we will [Ab/F]praise you for the [Bb]rest of our [Eb]days.

{comment: Bridge}
[Cm]Hallelujah [Ab/F]in the   [Bb]sanctua[Eb]ry.
[Cm]Hallelujah, [Ab/F]we       [Bb]give you the [Eb]glory.
[Cm]Hallelujah, [Ab/F]we give  [Bb]you the [Eb-Bb/D]praise,[Cm]
And we will [Ab/F]praise you for the [Bb]rest of our [Eb-Bb/D]days.[Cm]
Yes, we will [Ab/F]praise you for the [Bb]rest of our [Eb]days.
